a timed exam is being submitted during a brief connection problem. It does not extend the exam duration.":["K\u0131sa bir ba\u011flant\u0131 sorunu s\u0131ras\u0131nda yaln\u0131zca s\u00fcreli s\u0131nav teslim edilirken bu kadar ek saniye tan\u0131r. S\u0131nav s\u00fcresini uzatmaz."],"pixels":["piksel"],"Your exams, tests, participant results, and uploaded files are preserved when you deactivate Paper to Quiz.":["Paper to Quiz'i devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda s\u0131navlar\u0131n\u0131z, testleriniz, kat\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131 sonu\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131z ve y\u00fckledi\u011finiz dosyalar korunur."],"Delete all Paper to Quiz data when the plugin is deleted":["Eklenti silindi\u011finde t\u00fcm Paper to Quiz verilerini de sil"],"Use this only when you are finished with Paper to Quiz. Deleting the plugin will also permanently delete every exam, test, participant result, setting, and private file created by it.":["Bu se\u00e7ene\u011fi yaln\u0131zca Paper to Quiz'i art\u0131k kullanmayacaksan\u0131z a\u00e7\u0131n. Eklentiyi silmek; olu\u015fturdu\u011funuz t\u00fcm s\u0131navlar\u0131, testleri, kat\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131 sonu\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131, ayarlar\u0131 ve \u00f6zel dosyalar\u0131 da kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak siler."]}}}